WEBVTT

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:33.870
<b>Life
Savers</b>

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:42.080
Lifeguards watch over the
beach and the ocean.

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:45.250
They have what it takes
to save lives.

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:47.830
They truly are the protectors
of the ocean!

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.960
They are... LIFE SAVERS!

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:52.200
<b>LIFE SAVERS</b>

00:01:52.350 --> 00:01:53.840
Excuse me.

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:57.170
It looks like someone is
drowning over there.

00:01:57.620 --> 00:01:58.930
What?!

00:01:59.330 --> 00:02:01.890
Hang in there, I'm on my way!

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:03.800
I'm squidding drowning!

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:06.350
My tentacles cramped up!

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:11.350
<b>Wait a squid,
aren't you on my side?</b>

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:15.370
Squid Girl, are you okay?

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:17.150
Takeru? You know her?

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:21.370
My tentacles cramped because
I didn't stretch first.

00:02:23.190 --> 00:02:24.450
Stand back, Takeru!

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:29.910
Oh, don't worry about him.
Takeru's my squidling.

00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:31.250
I'm talking about you!

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:34.290
What's with those wavy things?!

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:39.630
I might have brought something
terrible ashore!

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:45.180
Hey, Squid Girl.

00:02:45.570 --> 00:02:46.770
What are you doing?

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:48.180
Oh. Hey, Sis.

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:52.440
Squid Girlie almost drowned,
so Goro rescued her.

00:02:52.740 --> 00:02:55.400
Huh? You know this human?

00:02:55.670 --> 00:02:58.410
Yeah, we grew up together.

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:01.540
Wait, how can you drown
when you're a squid?

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:05.370
I-I kinda forgot to stretch first.

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:06.750
What're you, a little kid?!

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:10.080
Anyway, how can you drown
when you came from the sea?

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:13.620
H-Holy squid!

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:17.590
I got used to life up here
and forgot all about it!

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:20.260
Thank you, Goro.

00:03:21.020 --> 00:03:22.090
This is on me.

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:26.430
Oh, you don't need to do that.
It's what we lifeguards do!

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:30.140
But I'm grateful that you're watching
out for us every day.

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:33.350
Could it be that this guy
is afraid of Chizuru?

00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:36.820
Yes! Nobody loves the
sea more than I do!

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:37.660
What?!

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:38.890
What do you mean "what"?

00:03:38.890 --> 00:03:40.610
Who the squid do you
think you are?!

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:44.050
I am Arashiyama Goro,
a life-saver who protects the sea!

00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:46.210
I am Squid Girl,
a messenger from the sea

00:03:46.210 --> 00:03:47.980
who protects all things aquatic!

00:03:57.380 --> 00:04:00.300
Hey Goro, do you even
know who she is?

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:03.300
Her love for the sea is genuine.

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:04.550
We're comrades-in-tentacles!

00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:08.510
She means something else...

00:04:08.780 --> 00:04:11.330
Well, then how about showing me

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:13.590
what your light saber
job is all about.

00:04:13.590 --> 00:04:15.150
It's "life saver"!

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:15.980
I'm coming, too!

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:19.190
My job actually has many responsibilities.

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:22.090
We patrol the beach, for one.

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:24.080
I see, they make sure
that the humans

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:25.450
don't squidly pollute the ocean.

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:27.780
We keep an eye on the strength
and direction of the tides.

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:31.290
I see, feeling the rage of
the ocean on your skin.

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:36.710
And lastly, we work out in order to be
prepared for when it gets serious.

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:40.250
I see, that's for the payback to humanity
that's bound to happen at some point.

00:04:41.110 --> 00:04:45.080
Hm, you're actually doing
quite well for a human.

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:47.550
Life-savers can't let
their guard down.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:52.270
By the way, what are you
doing to protect the sea?

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:53.060
Huh?

00:04:58.410 --> 00:04:59.060
Huh?

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:01.820
I-I'm not doing anything!

00:05:02.930 --> 00:05:04.520
Squid Girlie?

00:05:05.020 --> 00:05:07.780
Well, I'm doing a lot of stuff.

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:08.790
Like?

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:12.120
H-Hey, what's that?

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:18.580
We use that to look over the area
to see if anything's wrong.

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:22.970
A view fit for a king!

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:25.170
It's so high, it's great!

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:27.010
Hey, get back down here!

00:05:30.690 --> 00:05:31.730
Ah-ha!

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:35.840
Kneel you ignorant humans!

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:39.100
Pay respect to me, the
messenger of the sea!

00:05:39.320 --> 00:05:40.690
What are you doing?!

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:42.540
If we want to protect the sea,

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:43.820
we have to start with
subduing humanity!

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:46.000
What are you talking about?!

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:48.920
I take it back, you're not
a comrade-in-tentacles at all!

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:50.120
Squid Girlie!

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:53.450
I'll show you who's more suited

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:55.060
to be the messenger from the sea!

00:05:56.440 --> 00:06:00.000
Wouldn't it mean that I am more suited
to be the messenger from the sea

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:04.550
if he were to screw
up during his work?

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:14.220
Goro's getting in the water.

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:19.730
Why don't we let him taste the
humiliation of drowning.

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:34.590
What the?

00:06:34.590 --> 00:06:35.910
My leg's being pulled down!

00:06:38.320 --> 00:06:39.750
Are you all right?

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:40.370
Squid?!

00:06:40.730 --> 00:06:44.030
I guess even lifeguards
can drown, huh?

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:47.050
This isn't the time for that!

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:50.430
A child is drifting away over there!

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:57.430
Damn. I don't like asking an
untrained person like you,

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:59.330
but please, go help her!

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:04.020
You do know that you could
die here, too, right?

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:06.730
I'm not the one who's
asking for help here!

00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:09.620
Go save that child already!

00:07:11.890 --> 00:07:13.660
Thank you so much.

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:17.460
Oh, I wasn't actually
able to do anything.

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:20.210
You should be thanking her;
she's the one who saved her.

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:25.540
Thank you, lady.

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:35.770
Look at that, her squidness
actually did some good.

00:07:35.770 --> 00:07:37.860
I'm proud of you, Squid Girl.

00:07:37.860 --> 00:07:38.890
I wish I could have seen it.

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:43.140
It's not like I squidly saved
her because I wanted to.

00:07:43.140 --> 00:07:45.440
Humanity is my enemy after all!

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:47.400
But really, thanks.

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:49.130
You're not so bad after all.

00:07:51.350 --> 00:07:54.050
Thank you for saving me.
Thank you so much!

00:07:54.050 --> 00:07:55.910
I'm sorry for mocking you!

00:07:56.140 --> 00:07:59.360
That's how it should
have played out!

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:04.880
You're my enemy for all
squidding eternity!

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:13.180
Happy birthday, Yoshio.

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:18.310
Happy birthday.

00:08:19.110 --> 00:08:21.250
I've never seen this menu before.

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:23.230
Oh, that's a special menu.

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:26.820
Families who celebrate
a birthday here

00:08:26.820 --> 00:08:29.070
get a cake from us with
a huge discount.

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:30.190
Birthday?

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:35.160
On the surface world, people
celebrate the day we were born.

00:08:36.170 --> 00:08:37.660
The day they were born...

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:41.850
I guess she doesn't know
when she was born.

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:43.870
Then...

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:46.580
Today's my squidly birthday, too!

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:49.440
You should throw a
party for me, as well!

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:52.980
You just decided that.
You even said "then".

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:57.230
Who cares? I want
to squidly do this!

00:08:57.230 --> 00:09:00.770
You get more shameless every day.

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:04.550
Even if today was your birthday,

00:09:04.550 --> 00:09:07.440
we wouldn't celebrate the birthday
of an invader, we'd ignore it!

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:09.650
How dare you...

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:14.630
Why not? Let's throw
a party for her.

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:15.900
Yay!

00:09:15.900 --> 00:09:17.410
Sis, are you serious?

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:22.690
<b>Up for a squid-celebration?</b>

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:27.160
Lemon House at the Sea

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:27.170
We got the stuff.

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:31.130
What did you get?

00:09:38.350 --> 00:09:39.720
What are you doing?!

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:42.480
What else did you get?

00:09:44.420 --> 00:09:46.430
A golden tentacle?

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:48.400
I guess not.

00:09:48.860 --> 00:09:51.720
Show your-squidly-self!

00:09:52.260 --> 00:09:54.230
Hey, Squid Girl.

00:09:54.550 --> 00:09:57.120
You're so stubborn! Knock it off!

00:09:57.120 --> 00:09:58.070
Hey!

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:08.650
You stay here.

00:10:09.360 --> 00:10:10.690
Why the squid should I?!

00:10:10.690 --> 00:10:11.720
Because.

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:14.050
The main character doesn't
do stuff, okay?

00:10:15.390 --> 00:10:16.410
Main character?

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:19.310
That's right. I'll call you
when we're ready.

00:10:19.310 --> 00:10:20.960
So, stay put.

00:10:23.570 --> 00:10:25.110
I see.

00:10:25.110 --> 00:10:26.550
It looks like I am on my way

00:10:26.550 --> 00:10:28.850
to becoming the oversquid
of the surface world.

00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:33.500
That means it's natural for those
lowly people to work.

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:36.050
Wow, that's so nice, Sis.

00:10:36.050 --> 00:10:38.820
Isn't it? It's almost too nice for her.

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:41.830
Wow, Goro, you're
really going all out.

00:10:41.830 --> 00:10:44.030
Oh no, this is nothing.

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:46.200
What the squid is this?!

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:49.680
They're having fun without me!

00:10:50.140 --> 00:10:51.000
Could it be?!

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:53.930
Wow, that's so nice, sis.

00:10:53.930 --> 00:10:56.710
Isn't it? It's almost too nice for her.

00:10:56.970 --> 00:10:59.850
Wow, Goro, you're
really going all out.

00:10:59.850 --> 00:11:02.180
Oh no, this is nothing.

00:11:03.880 --> 00:11:07.180
Now, let's capture
Squid Girl and eat her!

00:11:11.090 --> 00:11:12.190
We're ready.

00:11:12.430 --> 00:11:14.400
Keep your tentacles off me!

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:18.960
Squid Girlie!

00:11:18.960 --> 00:11:21.070
Happy birthday!

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:34.760
I feel like I've accomplished
something quite squidiferous.

00:11:35.220 --> 00:11:36.840
You haven't accomplished anything.

00:11:37.330 --> 00:11:39.320
I brought the cake.

00:11:39.320 --> 00:11:41.480
Oh, then let's dig in!

00:11:41.480 --> 00:11:45.340
Wait, we have to put in
candles for each year.

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:47.000
How old are you?

00:11:51.160 --> 00:11:52.860
I don't know...

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:57.320
Well, judging from how
stupid you are,

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:58.480
this should be right.

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:01.240
I have lived a much
more fulfilled life!

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:04.200
10 or 20 won't do!

00:12:04.770 --> 00:12:06.160
This is more like it.

00:12:06.570 --> 00:12:08.720
How old are you really?

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:13.710
Squid Girlie, you have
to blow them out.

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:14.540
Then...

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:35.070
I feel dizzy...

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:36.970
Squid Girlie!

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:40.460
She hyperventilated.

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:43.190
This happened because you
had to put so many on.

00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:45.820
Hey, are you all right?

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:49.890
This time!

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:11.030
Squid ink...

00:13:11.530 --> 00:13:14.310
No one asked for a squid ink glaze.

00:13:14.630 --> 00:13:18.270
Umm, well this...

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:21.480
Only with squid ink is it
truly a squid's cake!

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:23.940
Who told you to make it yours?!

00:13:24.800 --> 00:13:27.260
Let's light some fireworks next!

00:13:27.260 --> 00:13:29.120
What a squidtastic idea!

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:32.990
Here you go, this is my
present for you.

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:35.870
So these are fireworks, huh?

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:38.970
Ooh, they're pretty.

00:13:39.680 --> 00:13:42.670
They're best on the beach at night.

00:13:44.910 --> 00:13:48.010
Huh? Were there this few?

00:13:48.410 --> 00:13:50.300
We had a lot a moment ago.

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:52.360
You're doing it wrong.

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:56.140
My way is overwhelmingly prettier!

00:13:57.500 --> 00:14:01.060
Why are you using your powers
for something like this?

00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:04.950
Hot, hot, hot!

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:06.490
Don't wave the fireworks around!

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:07.450
Water!

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:12.740
Squid Girlie, are you okay?

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:15.130
Be careful with fire!

00:14:15.130 --> 00:14:17.580
I don't think you're fit
to be an invader...

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:19.500
You can't even handle
fire properly.

00:14:19.770 --> 00:14:22.040
Wh-Who the squid asked you?!

00:14:22.470 --> 00:14:24.250
But it's weird.

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:25.260
What is?

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:27.270
I would think that fire would

00:14:27.270 --> 00:14:30.500
only strike fear into the
hearts of marine life.

00:14:31.590 --> 00:14:32.910
Now that you mention it,

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:35.890
I've heard that squids are
attracted to light.

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:37.000
Is it that?

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:40.480
Squid Girlie, watch out!

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:47.940
I thought I was going to die!
Takeru, how dare you!

00:14:46.270 --> 00:14:47.940
Are you a small animal?

00:14:52.550 --> 00:14:56.010
Jumping around, whimpering in
the sand; you're so restless.

00:14:56.420 --> 00:14:57.790
Don't worry.

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:16.810
It looks like the humans did this to
celebrate my birthday after all.

00:15:17.320 --> 00:15:19.480
Today was the day of
the big fireworks!

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:20.730
I forgot about that!

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:23.060
You can't get that in a store.

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:25.450
Yeah.

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:34.260
But you really have to wrap
it up with sparklers.

00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:35.870
There's something elegant
about them.

00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:39.410
I look forward to next
month's birthday.

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:43.010
Huh? Birthdays are once a year.

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:47.720
What? That's so squidly boring!

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:53.180
Cute!

00:15:56.740 --> 00:16:00.170
<b>Wanna play with this squid?</b>

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:02.750
What's his name?

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:04.190
It's Alex.

00:16:04.600 --> 00:16:06.310
Thank you, Sanae.

00:16:06.310 --> 00:16:08.650
Thanks for bringing such
a cute dog here!

00:16:09.130 --> 00:16:12.220
Eiko, you really love dogs, huh?

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:16.460
Aww, so cute. There there.

00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:18.350
What is this creature?

00:16:18.690 --> 00:16:20.120
You don't even know
what dogs are?

00:16:20.690 --> 00:16:23.240
Your knowledge is so random.

00:16:23.490 --> 00:16:26.780
In the ocean, I'm one of the more
knowledgeable squids!

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:30.670
Untentacle me!

00:16:31.400 --> 00:16:32.940
What are you doing?

00:16:32.940 --> 00:16:34.420
Sanae, this is bad!

00:16:34.830 --> 00:16:36.090
Alex!

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:39.420
Bad boy! Let go! Alex!

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:43.730
I'm sorry, are you all right?

00:16:44.050 --> 00:16:45.660
Really, are you all right?

00:16:47.010 --> 00:16:48.190
I'll manage...

00:16:48.380 --> 00:16:49.570
Not you!

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:53.570
You can't let a dog eat squid.

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:54.780
This makes no sense!

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:59.380
I'm sorry, Alex has this habit

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:01.370
of biting strange things
when he sees them.

00:17:02.350 --> 00:17:05.850
Alex, you can't do that,
you'll get a tummy-ache.

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:09.270
He did something bad,

00:17:09.270 --> 00:17:11.250
so how come I'm being
treated like this?!

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:12.800
Isn't it obvious?

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:14.450
He's cuter than you!

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:15.470
That's it?!

00:17:19.340 --> 00:17:22.190
You just thought,
"Oh, cute", didn't you?

00:17:22.190 --> 00:17:24.390
No, I squidly didn't!

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:27.940
Anyway, I should be loved
more than him!

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:32.570
Says the one who came
to subdue humanity.

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:35.040
Even if there were 100 of you,

00:17:35.040 --> 00:17:37.530
you wouldn't win against
Alex's cuteness.

00:17:38.670 --> 00:17:42.950
You will treat me just
like this creature!

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:45.830
Oh, are you sure?

00:17:48.610 --> 00:17:50.250
What the squid is this?

00:17:50.610 --> 00:17:53.630
It's a collar.
Alex has one too.

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:56.350
Squiddie's so cute.

00:17:57.990 --> 00:17:58.980
Sit!

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:00.720
Shake!

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:03.040
Down!

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:07.310
Aww, very good!

00:18:07.490 --> 00:18:10.660
This is supposed to be
equal treatment,

00:18:10.660 --> 00:18:13.110
but I feel like this is
worse than usual.

00:18:13.460 --> 00:18:16.860
I-I don't want this squidly
equal treatment!

00:18:17.390 --> 00:18:20.390
Aww, that's boring.

00:18:20.810 --> 00:18:23.190
Sis, so you were playing.

00:18:25.350 --> 00:18:26.660
I'm jealous...

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:27.210
Huh?

00:18:28.030 --> 00:18:29.580
Nothing.

00:18:37.060 --> 00:18:38.260
Welcome.

00:18:38.890 --> 00:18:40.340
Thanks.

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:44.420
Are you sure you want
this thing here?

00:18:44.420 --> 00:18:46.350
Stop being such an anti-cephalopod!

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:47.500
Yeah.

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:50.120
Squiddie, you came
to conquer us right?

00:18:50.620 --> 00:18:54.070
So I thought that seeing a human
home would be valuable.

00:18:56.700 --> 00:19:01.560
Oh Alex, you came to greet me?

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:03.870
So cute.

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:05.730
Squiddie!

00:19:05.730 --> 00:19:06.830
What?!

00:19:07.180 --> 00:19:08.830
What's to like about her?

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:10.790
What's to like?

00:19:13.690 --> 00:19:14.920
Everything?

00:19:14.940 --> 00:19:18.280
Love

00:19:15.260 --> 00:19:17.630
Is this... love?

00:19:18.280 --> 00:19:20.620
Pervert

00:19:18.730 --> 00:19:20.630
I think you mean perversion.

00:19:21.370 --> 00:19:25.010
Oh no, it's time for Alex's walk.

00:19:25.280 --> 00:19:28.260
But I have to watch the house...

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:30.090
I'll go.

00:19:30.090 --> 00:19:31.940
Really? Thanks!

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:41.780
Make yourself at home.

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:44.990
Why is it so cool in here?

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:49.560
It's air-conditioning.
Cold air comes out from there.

00:19:50.280 --> 00:19:52.160
That's squidly wonderful!

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:57.460
This temperature reminds me
of home. And this comfort!

00:19:57.800 --> 00:20:02.680
Even though it's an enclosed space,
it's nicer than the squidly Lemon.

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:07.260
I could see myself launching
my squid-vasion from here.

00:20:07.870 --> 00:20:10.650
But first I have to look
around more.

00:20:11.370 --> 00:20:14.300
Trip Diary    Squiddie

00:20:11.990 --> 00:20:13.930
My name?

00:20:24.470 --> 00:20:27.670
Will you help me with
my collection?

00:20:28.320 --> 00:20:31.410
Has the hunter become the hunted?!

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:37.340
Squiddie, you're so cute!

00:20:42.350 --> 00:20:46.760
You're too cute to be
working that part-time job!

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:50.220
I think I prefer it, actually.

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:53.570
I've got a lot more.

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:55.100
Squiii!

00:20:59.490 --> 00:21:02.850
Sanae's waiting, I should get back.

00:21:03.100 --> 00:21:05.290
Oh, Squid Girl's with her.

00:21:10.550 --> 00:21:11.990
Sanae's in danger!

00:21:13.680 --> 00:21:15.080
Sanae, are you okay?!

00:21:16.160 --> 00:21:18.970
Oh, Eiko, welcome back...

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:21.400
What's going on here?

00:21:22.110 --> 00:21:24.080
Alex

00:21:24.480 --> 00:21:26.250
Come over again.

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:27.220
Sure...

00:21:27.950 --> 00:21:31.810
Squiddie, you too!
I'll prepare a lot of new stuff.

00:21:32.650 --> 00:21:35.980
You mean, "come over to
be my toy," don't you?

00:22:03.900 --> 00:22:07.990
Every human around
you is a weirdo.

00:22:07.990 --> 00:22:09.000
Who do you think you are?!

00:22:09.000 --> 00:22:09.890
Ow!

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:43.480
Uh... Aizawa Eiko here.

00:23:43.480 --> 00:23:45.050
I'm seventeen and in my
second year of high school.

00:23:45.050 --> 00:23:45.820
Next time:

00:23:45.820 --> 00:23:46.900
Well aren't you a fraidy-squid?

00:23:46.900 --> 00:23:48.290
You're the squid's sworn enemy, aren't you?

00:23:48.290 --> 00:23:49.680
Squidzooks! Aren't you a new recruit?

00:23:49.680 --> 00:23:51.170
So, anyway,

00:23:51.170 --> 00:23:53.640
come down to Lemon House at the Sea,
receiving rave reviews all the time!
